      "id": "claim_919914c4c78147cfa399e59ea5eb0e53",
      "statement": "Root build/clean/test are Vite+ recursive runs: build is `vp run -r --cache build`, and test is the root's own node --test scripts suite followed by `vp run --filter '!cloudflare-os' --cache test`, which runs per-package test tasks while excluding the root package's own test script from the recursive selection.",
