      "statement": "A cached vp run executes tasks with only a built-in environment set, leaving undeclared build-time env vars invisible and unfingerprinted, and scripts/env-passthrough.test.ts fails the workspace if any discovered build-time env read is not categorized forwarded/uncached/injected/external.",
